answers.approach:
Trace one opt-out, little star, through every store and stream;
Start with maps and measured facts, not one grand token dream.

Give each scoped identity a purpose, clock, and chain;
Make each downstream system sign what it removed again.

Gate each sync and audience; send canaries to learn;
Reconcile the signed receipts and flag what won't return.

Quarantine affected models; retrain where we can do;
True unlearning is unsolved, so proof is partial too.
